    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1985928617088729141",
      "url": "https://x.com/ImePhilippines/status/1985928617088729141",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/ImePhilippines/status/1985928617088729141",
      "text": "🎩🔥 𝐌𝐀𝐆𝐈𝐂𝐌𝐀𝐍 𝟐 𝐖𝐎𝐑𝐋𝐃 𝐓𝐎𝐔𝐑 𝟐𝟎𝟐𝟓–𝟐𝟎𝟐𝟔 𝐈𝐍 𝐌𝐀𝐍𝐈𝐋𝐀 🔥🎤\n\n𝐖𝐇𝐀𝐓 𝐀 𝐂𝐑𝐀𝐙𝐘 𝐍𝐈𝐆𝐇𝐓 𝐌𝐀𝐍𝐈𝐋𝐀 💥\n\nLast November 2,  𝐉𝐀𝐂𝐊𝐒𝐎𝐍 𝐖𝐀𝐍𝐆 set the stage on FIRE and gave us a night we’ll never forget! Every performance was packed with surprises, passion, and pure artistry! 💫\n\nFrom the first beat to the final bow — 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐞𝐧𝐞𝐫𝐠𝐲, 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐜𝐫𝐨𝐰𝐝, 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐦𝐚𝐠𝐢𝐜 — everything was unreal! ✨\n\nWe 𝐥𝐚𝐮𝐠𝐡𝐞𝐝, 𝐬𝐜𝐫𝐞𝐚𝐦𝐞𝐝, 𝐬𝐚𝐧𝐠 𝐨𝐮𝐫 𝐡𝐞𝐚𝐫𝐭𝐬 𝐨𝐮𝐭, and lived every second of that magical night. ❤️\n\nThank you to everyone who came and made this experience truly 𝐨𝐧𝐞 𝐟𝐨𝐫 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐛𝐨𝐨𝐤𝐬! 💥\nTag your concert buddy and 𝐫𝐞𝐥𝐢𝐯𝐞 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐦𝐚𝐠𝐢𝐜 𝐚𝐥𝐥 𝐨𝐯𝐞𝐫 𝐚𝐠𝐚𝐢𝐧! 😍🪄\n\n#MAGICMAN2WORLDTOUR #JACKSONWANGWORLDTOUR #잭슨 #王嘉尔 #JacksonWang #TEAMWANGRecords #iMeAsia #iMePhilippines #iMePH @JacksonWang852",
